```php
function checkAuth(Request $request, Closure $next)
{
    // Get the authenticated user from the session
    $user = session('user');

    // If the user is not authenticated, return an unauthorized response
    if (!$user) {
        return response()->json(['error' => 'Unauthorized'], 401);
    }

    // If the user is authenticated, call the next middleware function
    return $next($request);
}
```
This middleware function uses the `session` helper function to get the authenticated user from the session. If the user is not authenticated, it returns an unauthorized response. If the user is authenticated, it calls the next middleware function in the pipeline.

