Here's a simple example of a bubble sort algorithm implemented in NAME_1:


```NAME_1
class BubbleSort {
    public static int[] sort(int[] arr) {
        int n = arr.length;
        int[] sorted = new int[n];
        int minIndex = 0;
        int maxIndex = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            if (arr[i] < arr[minIndex]) {
                sorted[minIndex] = arr[i];
                minIndex++;
            } else {
                sorted[maxIndex] = arr[minIndex];
                minIndex++;
                maxIndex++;
            }
        }
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            arr[i] = sorted[i];
        }
        return sorted;
    }
}

```

